      "content": "that makes sense. we'll look into the logs and backups. since we're drafting this as a guide for our junior engineers, do you have any tips on how we can ensure they don't accidentally leave little bits of data behind when they're performing these deletions? any specific red flags or common mistakes we should warn them about?",
